<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Yea, in Thy Name, O Captain of salvation!</l><l>In Thy dear Name, all other names above;</l><l>Jesus our Righteousness, our sure Foundation,</l><l>Our Prince of glory and our King of love.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We go in faith, our own great weakness feeling,</l><l>And needing more each day Thy grace to know:</l><l>Yet from our hearts a song of triumph pealing;</l><l>We rest on Thee, and in Thy Name we go.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We rest on Thee, our Shield and our Defender:</l><l>Thine is the battle, Thine shall be the praise</l><l>When reigning in the Kingdom of Thy splendor;</l><l>Victors, we rest with Thee, through endless days.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
